<template>
  <main class="page-home">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="hero__overline">Symbolic Computation Engine</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">输入表达式，<br>输出等价的表达式。</h1>
        <p class="hero__lede">SXO 是符号计算引擎：按规则重写数学表达式，每一步标注所用规则，结果可以代回原式验证。</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/d">阅读文档</a>
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="/playground">打开演练场</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__meta">Example · 平方差约分<br>规则：平方差 · 约分 · 回代验证<br>条件：<span class="hero__condition">x ≠ 1</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof" role="img" :aria-label="proofAriaLabel">
        <div class="proof__head"><b>Proof</b><span>Simplification · condition x ≠ 1</span></div>
        <div class="proof__row">
          <span class="proof__num">1</span>
          <span class="proof__rule">前提</span>
          <p class="proof__step">
            <span class="frac"><span class="frac__num">x<sup>2</sup> <span class="op">−</span> 1</span><span class="frac__den">x <span class="op">−</span> 1</span></span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof__row">
          <span class="proof__num">2</span>
          <span class="proof__rule">平方差</span>
          <p class="proof__step">
            <span class="frac"><span class="frac__num">(x <span class="op">−</span> 1)(x <span class="op">+</span> 1)</span><span class="frac__den">x <span class="op">−</span> 1</span></span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="proof__row">
          <span class="proof__num">3</span>
          <span class="proof__rule">约分</span>
          <div>
            <p class="proof__step">x <span class="op">+</span> 1<span class="proof__cond">x ≠ 1</span></p>
            <p class="proof__note"><span class="proof__note-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↳</span> 约分前先写明 x ≠ 1</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof__row proof__row--last">
          <span class="proof__num">4</span>
          <span class="proof__rule">验证</span>
          <p class="proof__step">
            x <span class="op">=</span> 2: <span class="frac"><span class="frac__num">4 <span class="op">−</span> 1</span><span class="frac__den">2 <span class="op">−</span> 1</span></span> <span class="op">=</span> 3<span class="proof__qed">∎</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="dialects-title">
      <div class="section__head">
        <h2 id="dialects-title">一种表达式模型，多种方言</h2>
        <p>各方言包把熟悉的源码解析进同一个表达式模型，再经 lowering 交给执行后端；渲染方向把结果写回方言记法。</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="dialect-list">
        <li><code>@sxo/mathematica</code><span>Wolfram 风格源码：parse、Form、lower、render</span></li>
        <li><code>@sxo/matlab</code><span>MATLAB 风格源码：矩阵记法与函数调用</span></li>
        <li><code>@sxo/pari-gp</code><span>PARI/GP 风格源码：数论函数与精度记号</span></li>
        <li><code>Maple</code><span>经宿主边界接入，Maple 表单进入 native 与 WASM 宿主会话</span></li>
        <li><code>@sxo/simple-math</code><span>小型可预测语法，用于示例、教学与测试</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="section__limit"><span class="section__limit-tag">边界 — </span>方言里熟悉的名字不等于完整覆盖：一个名字今天可能只完成解析，尚未可执行。覆盖度以各方言包的特性矩阵与结构化诊断为准。</p>
    </section>

